[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0010","text":"别乱动…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0020","text":"烦死了…………\n这种事我当然知道────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0030","text":"啊————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0040","text":"切…………\n都是因为你才掉下来的啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0050","text":"不，抱歉…………\n……那再来一次吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0060","text":"哈！吵死了…………\n谁还要玩这个啊…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0070","text":"我要…………\n更大、永远不会结束的东西────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0080","text":"啊哈哈！\n对对！大的大的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0090","text":"……诶，喂，这个烟花……\n是不是太大了！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12600200_03_0100","text":"没关系啦！\n就这个程度──！啊哈哈哈哈！"}]
